  1→//! Interactive user interface components.
  2→//!
  3→//! This module provides:
  4→//! - [`UserInterface`] trait for UI abstraction
  5→//! - [`TerminalUI`] for interactive terminal usage
  6→//! - [`NonInteractiveUI`] for CI/headless environments
  7→//! - Prompts, spinners, progress indicators, and tables
  8→//!
  9→//! # Example
 10→//!
 11→//! ```
 12→//! use bivvy::ui::{create_ui, OutputMode};
 13→//!
 14→//! // Use non-interactive mode for testability
 15→//! let mut ui = create_ui(false, OutputMode::Quiet);
 16→//! ui.show_header("My App");
 17→//! ui.success("Setup complete!");
 18→//! ```
